class Visitor~R~ {
  <<interface>>
  +visit(Greenhouse greenhouse) R
  +visit(Zone zone) R
  +visit(Crop crop) R
  +visit(Pump pump) R
  +visit(Lamp lamp) R
  +visit(Sensor sensor) R
  +visit(Heater heater) R
}
class PowerVisitor
class InventoryVisitor {
  -Map counts
  -double waterLitresPerDay
  +getTotalElements() int
  +getCounts() Map
}
class MaintenanceVisitor
class JsonExportVisitor
class WaterDemandVisitor
Visitor <|.. PowerVisitor : R is Double
Visitor <|.. InventoryVisitor : R is Void
Visitor <|.. MaintenanceVisitor : R is List of GreenhouseElement
Visitor <|.. JsonExportVisitor : R is String
Visitor <|.. WaterDemandVisitor : R is Double
GreenhouseElement ..> Visitor : accepts Visitor of R
note for GreenhouseElement "accept is generic in R; each concrete accept calls visitor.visit(this)"
note for Visitor "Seven concrete overloads; each visitor traverses containers through child.accept(this)"

InspectionService ..> Zone : affectedZone.accept(inspector) only
InspectionService --> Visitor : injected inspector returns list of elements
InspectionService --> Subject : reports with InspectionEvent
InspectionService ..> InspectionEvent : creates immutable report
Main ..> SoilSensor : creates and wires
Main ..> WeatherStation : creates and wires
Main ..> Greenhouse : creates immutable tree
Main ..> InspectionService : injects dependencies
